---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SearchVisualizer from '../../../components/algorithms/SearchVisualizer.vue';
---

<BaseLayout title="哈希查找动画演示 - Demo Center" description="哈希查找算法可视化演示：通过哈希函数定位桶，再用拉链法处理冲突，Java 代码同步高亮">
  <article class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-10">
    <a href="/algorithms" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-accent-dark dark:text-accent hover:underline mb-6">
      <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
      返回算法列表
    </a>

    <header class="mb-8">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
        <span class="text-3xl">🗝️</span>
        <div>
          <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">哈希查找</h1>
          <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">Hash Search · 哈希函数 + 拉链法，平均 O(1)</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-4">
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-mono font-bold bg-green-100 dark:bg-green-900/30 text-green-600 dark:text-green-400">无需有序</span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-mono font-bold bg-gray-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-400">O(1)</span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-mono font-bold bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/30 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">O(n) 空间</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <SearchVisualizer client:load algorithm="hash" initialArray={[12, 25, 15, 28, 40, 55, 68]} target={40} />

    <section class="mt-12 space-y-6">
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/40">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3">核心思想</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          哈希查找通过<strong>哈希函数</strong>把关键字直接映射到存储位置。理想情况下一次计算就能定位，时间复杂度接近 O(1)。当多个关键字映射到同一位置时，用<strong>拉链法</strong>把冲突元素串成链表存放在同一个桶中。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/40">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">复杂度分析</h2>
        <div class="overflow-x-auto">
          <table class="w-full text-sm text-left">
            <thead class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-slate-400 uppercase bg-gray-50 dark:bg-slate-800/50">
              <tr>
                <th class="px-4 py-2 rounded-l-lg">情况</th>
                <th class="px-4 py-2">时间复杂度</th>
                <th class="px-4 py-2 rounded-r-lg">说明</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="text-gray-700 dark:text-slate-300">
              <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 dark:border-slate-800">
                <td class="px-4 py-3">最优 / 平均</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono font-bold text-green-600 dark:text-green-400">O(1)</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-3">哈希函数均匀，冲突少</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 dark:border-slate-800">
                <td class="px-4 py-3">最差</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono font-bold text-red-500 dark:text-red-400">O(n)</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-3">所有关键字都冲突，退化成链表遍历</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="px-4 py-3">空间</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono font-bold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">O(n)</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-3">需要额外哈希表存储所有关键字</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/40">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3">冲突处理</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-3">
          本演示使用<strong>拉链法（Separate Chaining）</strong>：每个桶维护一个链表，发生冲突的元素依次追加到链表末尾。查找时先定位到桶，再遍历该桶的链表。
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          另一种常见方法是<strong>开放寻址法（Open Addressing）</strong>：冲突时按某种探测序列（线性探测、二次探测、双哈希）寻找下一个空槽。
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
